{
  "bodyHash": "+xB4vZqBb2Q=",
  "content": "<!--suppress HtmlDeprecatedAttribute -->\n\n\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">\n\n<p><img width=\"836\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/banner.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/></p>\n\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-armors\">\n<img alt=\"Modrinth\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=000000&color=00AF5C\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-armors\">\n<img alt=\"CurseForge\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=000000&color=F16436\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\">\n<img alt=\"Discord\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=000000&color=5865F2\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveArmors\">\n<img alt=\"Github\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&color=181717\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://crowdin.com/project/immersive-collection\">\n<img alt=\"通过 Crowdin 翻译\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Crowdin-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=crowdin&color=2E3340\">\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<p>\n沉浸式装甲为游戏添加了一系列原版风格且独特的装甲套装。与单调的复制粘贴式装甲不同，沉浸式装甲注重视觉增强，部分装甲还带有披风或自定义模型。大多数装甲提供专属效果，如狂暴模式、反弹、尖刺、神圣庇护等。合成配方已正确收录在原版合成书中。附魔、修复、染色功能均正常运作。\n</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<p>新增40多种装甲物品，且持续增加中！</p>\n<p>\n\n\n\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/atlas?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=_immersive_armors%3Aarmor&dependencies=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FLuke100000%2FImmersiveArmors%2Ftree%2F1.20.1&resolution=48&background=fancy&row_size=8\" alt=\"生成的装甲图集\"/></p></p>\n\n<h1>木质装甲</h1>\n<p>不知道你怎么想，反正我厌倦了被骷髅偷袭。这套原始但有效的装甲能提供不错的箭矢和爆炸防护。</p>\n<img width=\"450\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=450,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/wood.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>骷髅装甲</h1>\n<p>想过把你的敌人变成装甲吗？可能没有，但这里有一套轻便的骷髅装甲。它能让你移动更快，凋灵装甲更是如此。骷髅不再攻击你。而且会伤害一切试图触碰你的东西！</p>\n<img width=\"600\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=600,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/skeleton.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>神圣装甲</h1>\n<p>想脱颖而出？给你，一套华丽的金红相间装甲。随意为布料染色吧。除了外观漂亮并拥有超凡的防护力外，全套神圣装甲每分鐘能完全格挡一次攻击！</p>\n<img width=\"500\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=500,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/divine.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>重型装甲</h1>\n<p>高护甲、高韧性、几乎无击退，但牺牲了机动性。这套装甲旨在碾压最强悍的敌人。</p>\n<img width=\"400\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=400,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/heavy.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>史莱姆装甲</h1>\n<p>好吧，我知道这看起来不像装甲。但相信我，它很管用。攻击你的敌人会被弹开，爆炸伤害也会大幅降低！不过穿戴后可能会有点味道……</p>\n<img width=\"300\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=300,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/slime.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>战士装甲</h1>\n<p>这不仅仅是维京盔甲，穿上它，你将成为真正的维京人！斧头伤害更高，并且每损失一点生命值，整体伤害也会增加。陷入狂暴模式，在残酷的近战中斩杀敌人！</p>\n<img width=\"400\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=400,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/warrior.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>长袍装甲</h1>\n<p>蓬松、可染色的羊毛装甲。注入烈焰棒后，能对攻击者造成火焰伤害！哦，它还防火。因为烈焰棒嘛。科学！</p>\n<img width=\"600\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=600,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/robe.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>蒸汽朋克装甲</h1>\n<p>旋转的齿轮、黄铜、指南针、时钟，还有大量烟雾。让我为您呈现最复杂的装甲套装——蒸汽朋克装甲。头盔配备潜行时激活的敌对生物雷达系统。胸甲提供增强型界面，让你再也不会忘记时间！护腿装备了二段跳功能，而靴子则凭借内置的蒸汽喷气彻底防止摔落伤害。</p>\n<img width=\"500\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=500,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/steampunk.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>海晶石装甲</h1>\n<p>利用守卫者的尖刺为自己谋利！这件带刺的装甲会对攻击者造成……呃……尖刺伤害。虽然坚固的岩石会让你行动变慢，但它也提供了深海探索者效果。</p>\n<img width=\"450\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=450,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/prismarine.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>视频评测！</h1>\n<p style=\"display:block;font-size: 16px; text-align: center;font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif;\">\n<iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kuGRRFDy7vY?wmode=transparent\"\nheight=\"480\" width=\"872\"></iframe>\n</p>\n\n<h1>如何合成？</h1>\n<p>\n所有物品都已集成到原版合成书（以及任何类似JEI的模组）中。需要骨头、铁块、海晶碎片、羊毛、史莱姆、活塞、皮革盔甲、长袍、凋灵骷髅头颅和木头来解锁配方。\n</p>\n<p>\n\n\n\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/recipes?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=immersive_armors%3A.%2A&dependencies=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FLuke100000%2FImmersiveArmors%2Ftree%2F1.20.1&resolution=16&animated=False&row_width=835\" alt=\"生成的配方图片\"/></p></p>\n\n<h1>翻译</h1>\n<p>\n沉浸式装甲通过机器翻译提供了多种语言版本，但由于质量往往较差，欢迎您通过\n<a href=\"https://crowdin.com/project/immersive-collection\">Crowdin</a>参与翻译工作。\n<br/>\n欢迎给差的翻译投反对票并提交您自己的版本。\n</p>\n\n<h1>不兼容性</h1>\n<p>Epic Fight 模组（装甲会使用丑陋的回退模型）</p>\n<p>尝试以降低透明度渲染装甲的模组</p>\n\n<h1>整合</h1>\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/hostile-humans\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Hostile%20Humans&description=Adds%20Hostile%20Humans%20with%20structures%20into%20your%20world&icon_url=https%3A//media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/798/586/64/64/638160491085728200.jpeg&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Hostile Humans\"/>\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h1>沉浸系列</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-armors\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Armors&description=A%20lot%20of%20unique%20and%20vanilla-faithful%20armor%20sets.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Armors\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-aircraft\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Aircraft&description=A%20bunch%20of%20rustic%20aircraft%20to%20travel%2C%20transport%2C%20and%20explore%21&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Aircraft\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-melodies\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Melodies&description=Play%20custom%20melodies%20on%20various%20instruments%20and%20annoy%20your%20friends%21&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Melodies\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-paintings\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Paintings&description=Drag%20and%20drop%2C%20pixelate%20and%20hang%20up%20beautiful%20art.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Paintings\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-optimization\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Optimization&description=A%20lightweight%20entity-tick-scheduler%20for%20doubling%20your%20TPS.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Optimization\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/selectivebounds\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=SelectiveBounds&description=Hides%20the%20ugly%20block%20selection%20outline%20when%20not%20relevant.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"SelectiveBounds\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/man-of-many-planes\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Man%20of%20Many%20Planes&description=A%20set%20of%20additional%20aircraft%20for%20Immersive%20Aircraft%20with%20Create%20support%20in%20mind.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/man-of-many-planes/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Man of Many Planes\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-machinery\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Machinery&description=A%20bunch%20of%20rustic%20machinery%20to%20transport%2C%20mine%2C%20and%20automate%20things.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Machinery\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-furniture\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Furniture&description=Create%20custom%20and%20fancy%20furniture%20in-game%20or%20choose%20from%20a%20vast%20online%20library.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-furniture/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Furniture\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-gateways\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Gateways&description=Mysterious%2C%20long-forgotten%20portals%20scattered%20across%20the%20Overworld.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Gateways\"/>\n</a></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<p>不喜欢这个颜色？部分装甲套装是可染色的！</p>\n<img width=\"700\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=700,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/dyeable.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/nostalgia-shader\">\n截图中使用的光影为 Nostalgia Shader\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n</div>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/pixel.png?immersive_pages_hash=1c6d81e57aac0f3dfbd4c31c7e6b7ae7\" alt=\"方便部署页面的页面哈希值\"/>",
